  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Promotion and System Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Health Promotion and System Strengthening Project is a SDC flagship project in Tanzania. In this third and exit phase, the project will strengthen the efficiency of national institutions to scale up policy reform processes that have been introduced based on the successful health innovations financed by SDC. The institutional capacity of 187 district councils will be enhanced to improve access to social protection, medicines supply, medical equipment maintenance and health promotion through technical assistance, digitalized solutions and researches for policy dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
